sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Sender
  actor B as Recipient
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant TB as TablesDB
  participant RT as Realtime
  A->>API: POST /conversations/:id/messages
  API->>API: Check member, connection open, account active
  API->>DB: Transaction: message (idempotent), outbox
  API-->>A: Saved message
  API->>TB: Update B's signal row
  TB->>RT: Row update event
  RT-->>B: Signal (no content)
  B->>API: GET messages after cursor
  API-->>B: New messages
  Note over DB,B: Offline: outbox sends push. Foreground: app always refetches
